question:
A Zomato SDE off-campus interview asked a chain of sorting and heap questions:

- **Quick sort vs merge sort**: time complexity, stability and practical use;
- how to **parallelise merge sort with multiple threads**;
- can merge sort be done in **O(1) extra space**;
- how a modified merge sort behaves on a **multi-core vs single-core** CPU;
- **heap vs sorting**: when to prefer a heap;
- **heap pseudocode** (insert, delete, heapify) with time and space complexity.
